:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCF a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A dog older than 4 months must be registered with the local authority and must carry a microchip." .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCN a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Some breeds are classified as dangerous by the local authority. Check the local list before you choose a breed." .

:su_01M82GXF5BZJDB4QGXVFMJEB31 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An **outdoor cat** goes outside on its own. It must be vaccinated and microchipped before it goes outside for the first time." .

