:su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3Q a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Dogs are social animals. **Never leave an adult dog alone at home for more than 6 hours.** Puppies should not be left alone for more than 2 hours." .

:su_01M82GXF5BZJDB4QGXVFMJEB30 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An **indoor cat** never leaves the flat. On average it lives longer, but it needs more play and climbing places." .

