:cn_01M82GPB8ZK0N7S1VR303H5EPB a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "leash" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP1,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP3,
        :su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3W ;
    dai:level dai:level-1 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCE a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A dog lives 10 to 15 years. It needs daily exercise, company, training and veterinary care for its whole life. Before you get a dog, check that your home, your working hours and your budget fit the dog you want." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNZ a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "House training starts on the first day: take the puppy outside after every meal, after every nap and after play, and praise it when it relieves itself outside. Between 8 and 16 weeks, let the puppy get to know many people, sounds, surfaces and traffic in a calm way." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPE a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A dog training course with a certified trainer is recommended in the first year. Dogs of breeds classified as dangerous must pass an obedience test." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F9 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A kitten is a cat younger than 6 months. Kittens should not leave their mother before 12 weeks of age. Let a new kitten explore one room first, then the rest of the flat. Kittens learn to use the litter box quickly if it is easy to reach." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP3 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Start leash training when the puppy is 8 to 10 weeks old. Reward the dog when the leash is loose, and stop walking when the dog pulls. Never jerk the leash." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FF a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An adult cat can stay alone for up to 24 hours if it has enough food, fresh water and a clean litter box. For longer absences, arrange for someone to visit the cat at least once a day." .

:cn_01M82GS0NSGHH6X6DCYVS251BV a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:definition "One of five commands every dog should learn: sit, down, stay, come and leave it." ;
    skos:prefLabel "basic command" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPD ;
    dai:level dai:level-2 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCS a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A puppy receives its first vaccinations at 8 weeks of age. The rabies vaccination is mandatory and must be renewed every year. Take your dog to the veterinarian for a check-up at least once a year." .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPD a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Every dog should learn five basic commands: *sit*, *down*, *stay*, *come* and *leave it*. Train in short sessions of 5 to 10 minutes, several times a day, and always end with a success." .

:cn_01M82GZMM3VP80T7XD6GS67TSK a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "litter box" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GXF5BZJDB4QGXVFMJEB33,
        :su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F7,
        :su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F9,
        :su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FB,
        :su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FF,
        :su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FH ;
    dai:level dai:level-2 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3R a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Before you leave, walk the dog, leave water and a safe chew toy, and keep your departure low-key. If your dog barks or howls while you are away, train it to be alone step by step, starting with a few minutes." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FH a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Cats are attached to their territory. On moving day, keep the cat in a closed room with its litter box. After the move, keep an outdoor cat indoors for at least 2 weeks before you let it outside, so that it learns its new home." .

:cn_01M82GNRCASH6DKSRYKE0WQE7V a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:maxQualifiedCardinality "4"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
            owl:minQualifiedCardinality "3"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
            owl:onClass :cn_01M82GM2G3AM0SX444VHV3202H ;
            owl:onProperty :rl_01M82GM2G3AM0SX444VHV3202T ],
        :cn_01M82GJP3CRKNX3DNJZDNANDWM ;
    skos:broader :cn_01M82GJP3CRKNX3DNJZDNANDWM ;
    skos:definition "A dog younger than 6 months." ;
    skos:prefLabel "puppy" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCQ,
        :su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCS,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNY,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDNZ,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP3,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP5,
        :su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3Q ;
    dai:level dai:level-3 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP1 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Use a leash of 1.5 to 2 metres for everyday walks. A retractable leash is not suitable in busy streets. Attach the leash to a well-fitting collar or harness: you should be able to slide two fingers under the collar." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FB a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Play with your cat for at least 15 minutes twice a day. A cat that scratches furniture usually needs a better scratching post, not punishment. Never punish a cat physically. A cat that suddenly stops using its litter box may be ill and should see a veterinarian." .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCQ a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Feed an adult dog twice a day and a puppy three to four times a day. Fresh water must always be available. Chocolate, grapes, onions and xylitol are poisonous to dogs." .

:su_01M82GHYMP28WWGVJCAF7BMQCV a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Brush your dog at least once a week; long-haired breeds need brushing every day. Trim the claws when you can hear them clicking on the floor. Wash your dog's bed and blankets once a week at 60 °C." .

:su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3T a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "In a car, a dog must travel in a crate or wear a safety harness attached to the seat belt. Never leave a dog in a parked car in warm weather. For travel abroad, your dog needs a pet passport, a microchip and a valid rabies vaccination." .

:su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3W a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "You are liable for any damage your dog causes. Third-party liability insurance for dog owners is strongly recommended, and it is mandatory for breeds classified as dangerous by the local authority. In public places, your dog must be kept on a leash unless a sign allows free running." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F7 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Provide one litter box per cat plus one extra. Remove clumps every day and replace all litter once a week. Used litter goes into the residual waste, never into the toilet or the compost." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5FD a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Short-haired cats groom themselves; brush them once a week to reduce hair in the flat. Long-haired cats need brushing every day to prevent matting. Do not bathe a cat unless the veterinarian advises it." .

:su_01M82GXF5BZJDB4QGXVFMJEB2X a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A cat lives 12 to 18 years. Cats are independent, but they still need daily attention, play and a clean environment. Plan for food, litter, yearly veterinary visits and someone to look after the cat when you travel." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F5 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "A kitten receives its first vaccinations at 8 weeks of age. A cat that goes outdoors must also be vaccinated against rabies, renewed every year. Neuter your cat at about 5 to 6 months of age. Visit the veterinarian at least once a year." .

:cn_01M82GR8C6YNAW05QP8GX3MF7P a owl:Class,
        skos:Concept ;
    skos:altLabel "owner" ;
    skos:prefLabel "dog owner" ;
    dai:evidence :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP5,
        :su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDPB,
        :su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3R,
        :su_01M82GHYMR2WSZZZXCEPR86V3W ;
    dai:level dai:level-1 ;
    dai:status dai:proposed .

:su_01M82GHYMQYRXNHXCXTMK9HDP5 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "An adult dog needs at least two walks a day: 30 to 60 minutes in total for small breeds and up to 2 hours for large and working breeds. A puppy must be taken outside to relieve itself every 2 to 3 hours. Always pick up your dog's waste and put it in a waste bin." .

:su_01M82GXF5CK27HSSNSY54SX5F3 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Feed an adult cat two to three small meals a day; kittens need four meals a day. Cats need meat-based food. Lilies, onions, chocolate and dog food are not suitable for cats; lilies are highly poisonous." .

:su_01M82GXF5BZJDB4QGXVFMJEB33 a dai:SourceUnit ;
    rdfs:label "Every cat needs a litter box, a scratching post, food and water bowls placed away from the litter box, and a quiet place to sleep. Secure windows and balconies with a net, because cats can fall from height." .

